% home — the home's crossing preds: a scene's wish, from the scenes package (the planner) to the packages
% that carry it out (the timers: the reminders waiting for the mode), one kind each so the director routes it to its one handler. Declaration only.
catalog home_iface 1.
provenance text "the home's crossing preds: a scene's wish to the lights, the air and the media" "2026-11-24".
types (scene).
type mood {calm cozy focus lively sleep wake}.

namespace home_iface produce (dyn).

pred scene_lights(scene) : home_iface.
pred scene_air(scene) : home_iface.
pred scene_media(scene) : home_iface.
pred scene_timers(scene) : home_iface.
pred scene_music(scene) : home_iface.
% a mood (the atmosphere's), one wish per domain that expresses it
pred mood_music(mood) : home_iface.
pred mood_glow(mood) : home_iface.
